{"id":"04d24c4f69f28d75","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-prob-pushforward-measure.md","title":"ZFC Prob Pushforward Measure","display":"df-zfc-prob-pushforward-measure — ZFC Prob Pushforward Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob-pushforward-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob-pushforward-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-prob-pushforward-measure — ZFC Prob Pushforward Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob-pushforward-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob-pushforward-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob-pushforward-measure — ZFC Prob Pushforward Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c202e401aa180874\" href=\"?note=c202e401aa180874\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md\">58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,f,\\nu\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,f,\\nu\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\">\\(\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbPushforwardMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbPushforwardMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c202e401aa180874\" href=\"?note=c202e401aa180874\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md\">58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}pushforward\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbPushforwardMeasure}_S(\\nu,f,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(f,X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\nu(B)=\\mu(f^{-1}[B])).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}pushforward\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbPushforwardMeasure}_S(\\nu,f,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(f,X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\nu(B)=\\mu(f^{-1}[B])).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md","status":"resolved